  "title": "Easy Slow Cooker Pulled Chicken Tacos",
  "description": "These pulled chicken tacos have more than just chicken in the filling--they&#39;re loaded with a hearty mixture of bell peppers, salsa, zesty tomatoes, and corn.",
  "authors": [
